{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41866","headline":"赠上都先业大师 · 李中","name":"赠上都先业大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"懒向人前着紫衣，虚堂闲倚一条藜。\n虽承雨露居龙阙，终忆烟霞梦虎溪。\n睡起晓窗风淅淅，病来深院草萋萋。\n有时乘兴寻师去，煮茗同吟到日西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41866.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41866","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}